# Smoke: one existing provider to its decision, architecture, and implementation.
id: onboarding-smoke
skill: highway-onboarding
through: highway-adr
through: highway-architecture
through: highway-implementation
fixture: setup
smoke: yes
open: /highway-onboarding We build, deploy, and run scheduled jobs for every repository with GitHub Actions on GitHub-hosted runners.
ask: What would you add, correct, or remove?
say: [accept] Looks good.
ask: What would you add, correct, or remove?
say: [accept] Looks good.
ask: What would you add, correct, or remove?
say: [accept] Looks good.
ask-pattern: Would you like to configure how highway-codify uses
say: [decline] Not now.
ask: Where would you like to go next?
say: [decline] Nothing else for now.
ask-pattern: \?
say: [unknown] I don't know.
writes: adrs/**
writes: architectures/**
writes: implementations/**
writes: library/coding-standards/codify-platforms.md
expect: template adrs/adrs.md :: adr-catalog.md
expect: template architectures/architectures.md :: architecture-catalog.md
expect: template implementations/implementations.md :: implementation-catalog.md
expect: template adrs/ADR*.md :: adr-record.md
expect: template architectures/RA*.md :: architecture-record.md
expect: template implementations/RI*.md :: implementation-record.md
expect: row adrs/adrs.md :: onboarding
expect: row adrs/adrs.md :: | RA
